  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960248,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Division Manager - Commodore 64\n\nStep into the boots of a football manager in *1st Division Manager*, the definitive football simulation for the Commodore 64! Choose your team from the top four leagues of English football and embark on a thrilling journey to glory. \n\nExperience the highs and lows of managing a professional club. Scout for new talent, train your players, and craft winning strategies to dominate your rivals. Each match brings intense on-field action, followed by detailed post-match reports.  Analyze player injuries, track the results of competing teams, and carefully manage your club's finances to ensure long-term success. \n\nWill you lead your team to the championship title? Or will financial woes and player injuries derail your ambitions? *1st Division Manager* offers a deep and rewarding management experience, demanding tactical brilliance and shrewd decision-making.  Prove your managerial skills and become a legend of English football!"
    },
